<<
/Title (When we consume products from a slaughterhouse, aka a torture chamber, we inevitably reinforce the very same energetic ties that many of us want to break free from in our daily lives. Instead of protesting on the streets every few months, we can protest every day with the dietary choices that we make. When we redirect our attention and purchasing power to a practice that carries harmonic resonance with peace, non-violence, and regeneration, we strengthen a web that reinforces an existence founded upon these principles.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 4660 0 R
