4674 0 obj
<<
/Title (When we consume ANYTHING from the egg, meat, and dairy industries, we inevitably give this industry our POWER. This power gets compounded over time. Ultimately, we have to ask ourselves: which structures do we want to weaken, and which energetic currencies do we want to strengthen? Demand and Supply mechanisms work organically. We know this from economies of scale; higher demand creates higher supply. Therefore, the lower the demand, the lower the supply. This might be an over-simplification of this dynamic - yet how lovely it is to imagine all slaughterhouses and factory farms shutting down because the demand for meat and dairy was not enough to sustain their operations. If you enjoy using your imagination to create the world that you want to be a part of, then I suggest you join my cosmickittyinspace/Ana Not Ana Discord Channel where we do exactly that.)
/Dest [27 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 4670 0 R
/Next 4678 0 R
>>
endobj
